新】北海道 登別温泉・地獄谷の秋紅葉絶景＆自家製生いくらビュッフェ・7泉質大浴場名宿特集！</p>\n            <p class=\"text-[11px] text-stone-500 line-clamp-1\">登別・洞爺・室蘭</p>\n          </a>\n        \n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- 近隣・隣接都道府県の人気特集 -->\n    <div class=\"p-4 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-stone-200/90 shadow-sm space-y-3\">\n      <h4 class=\"text-xs font-black text-orange-900 flex items-center gap-1.5 border-b border-orange-100 pb-2\">\n        <span>🚗</span> 周遊・隣接エリアのおすすめ特集\n      </h4>\n      <div class=\"space-y-2\">\n        \n          <a href=\"/posts/aomori-hotels-selection-guide\" class=\"block group p-2.5 rounded-xl hover:bg-orange-50 transition border border-transparent hover:border-orange-200\">\n            <p class=\"text-xs font-bold text-stone-800 group-hover:text-orange-700 transition line-clamp-1\">🏨 【青森県】【2026年最新】青森おすすめホテル・温泉旅館10選！</p>\n            <p class=\"text-[11px] text-stone-500 line-clamp-1\">青森県全域（奥入瀬渓流十和田湖・八甲田酸ヶ湯・弘前津軽・青森市街浅虫・八戸大間）</p>\n          </a>\n        \n          <a href=\"/posts/iwate-hotels-selection-guide\" class=\"block group p-2.5 rounded-xl hover:bg-orange-50 transition border border-transparent hover:border-orange-200\">\n            <p class=\"text-xs font-bold text-stone-800 group-hover:text-orange-700 transition line-clamp-1\">🏨 【岩手県】【2026年最新】岩手おすすめ温泉旅館・ホテル10選！</p>\n            <p class=\"text-[11px] text-stone-500 line-clamp-1\">岩手県全域（花巻温泉郷遠野・平泉一関・盛岡市街繋温泉雫石・三陸海岸宮古釜石）</p>\n          </a>\n        \n          <a href=\"/posts/miyagi-hotels-selection-guide\" class=\"block group p-2.5 rounded-xl hover:bg-orange-50 transition border border-transparent hover:border-orange-200\">\n            <p class=\"text-xs font-bold text-stone-800 group-hover:text-orange-700 transition line-clamp-1\">🏨 【宮城県】【2026年最新】宮城おすすめホテル・名湯温泉旅館10選！</p>\n            <p class=\"text-[11px] text-stone-500 line-clamp-1\">宮城県全域（仙台市街・秋保温泉・松島・鳴子温泉郷・遠刈田温泉）</p>\n          </a>\n        \n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"pt-3 text-center border-t border-amber-